<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/values.css">

<section class="values-page">
  <section class="site-hero">
    <div class="site-hero__inner">
      <h1>Values &amp; Philosophy</h1>
      <p>Building confident, creative, and resilient individuals through the game of soccer.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="core-values-section">
    <div class="values-container">
      <div class="section-heading dark-text">
        <h2>Our Core Values</h2>
        <p>The acronym <strong>DEDICATE</strong> represents the values we believe are essential for success both on and off the field.</p>
      </div>

    <div class="core-values-grid">
      <div class="core-value-card">
        <div class="value-letter">D</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Devotion</h3>
          <p>Commitment to achieving personal and team goals</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="core-value-card">
        <div class="value-letter">E</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Enthusiasm</h3>
          <p>Bringing passion, energy, and joy to everything we do</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="core-value-card">
        <div class="value-letter">D</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Determination</h3>
          <p>Pushing through challenges and adversity</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="core-value-card">
        <div class="value-letter">I</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Integrity</h3>
          <p>Holding ourselves to high moral standards</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="core-value-card">
        <div class="value-letter">C</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Care</h3>
          <p>Supporting our teammates and community</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="core-value-card">
        <div class="value-letter">A</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Alliance</h3>
          <p>Building strong relationships within and beyond the club</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="core-value-card">
        <div class="value-letter">T</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Together</h3>
          <p>Achieving goals through teamwork and unity</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="core-value-card">
        <div class="value-letter">E</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Excellence</h3>
          <p>Striving for the highest standards on and off the field</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="philosophy-section">
    <div class="values-container">
      <div class="section-heading dark-text">
        <h2>Our Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          We use soccer as a vehicle to develop confident, hardworking, intelligent, self-aware, and creative individuals.
          Players are supported in a safe and structured environment where they are encouraged to express themselves and grow.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="philosophy-card-grid">
        <div class="philosophy-card">
          <h3>Development Approach</h3>
          <p>
            We believe development happens when players are challenged. Our goal is to help players become comfortable
            with being uncomfortable, encouraging growth through both successes and adversity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="philosophy-card">
          <h3>Philosophy in Action</h3>
          <p>
            Our youth programs emphasize fun, skill development, and creativity, helping players build a strong foundation
            and love for the game while continuing to support individual expression and leadership.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pathway-section">
    <div class="values-container pathway-top">
      <div class="pathway-image-wrap">
        <img src="/images/values/player-development-pathway.svg" alt="Player Development Pathway" class="pathway-image">
      </div>

      <div class="pathway-text">
        <h2>Player Development Pathway</h2>
        <p>
          Our youth programs emphasize fun, skill development, and creativity, helping players build a strong foundation
          and love for the game. As players grow, we introduce more tactical and competitive elements while continuing
          to support individual expression and leadership.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="values-container pathway-card-grid">
      <div class="pathway-card">
        <h3>Developmental Level – Ages 6 to 8</h3>
        <p>
          The developmental player is learning how to use their bodies, move in space, and the basics of game play.
          At these ages the focus is on the player’s relationship to the ball, basic cooperation, and having fun while
          developing a love for soccer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pathway-card">
        <h3>Competitive Level – Ages 9-12</h3>
        <p>
          The competitive player is introduced to a more intense training environment with a greater focus on match play
          and continued building of Soccer IQ. Creativity and fun are still heavily reinforced.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pathway-card">
        <h3>Advanced – Ages 13-15</h3>
        <p>
          The advanced player has mastered control of the ball and begins introduction into the full 11-a-side match,
          increased decision-making, and greater tactical intensity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pathway-card">
        <h3>Elite – Ages 16 &amp; Up</h3>
        <p>
          The elite player seeks to play at the highest possible level. Players at this level often pursue professional
          or collegiate pathways and train at the highest level they can on a daily basis.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>